asahi-scripts: asahi-scripts (Apple Silicon maintenance scripts)
asahi-scripts:
asahi-scripts: Maintenance scripts for Asahi Linux on Apple Silicon. The key
asahi-scripts: one for Slackware is update-m1n1, which assembles and installs
asahi-scripts: the m1n1 stage 2 payload at <ESP>/m1n1/boot.bin from the m1n1 and
asahi-scripts: U-Boot in hwm-bw-mac and the newest installed kernel's device trees.
asahi-scripts:
asahi-scripts: Configured via /etc/default/update-m1n1. The Arch/Fedora initrd
asahi-scripts: and systemd integration is not packaged for Slackware.
asahi-scripts: Setup does not run it: the Asahi installer's boot.bin is kept.
asahi-scripts: Homepage: https://asahilinux.org/
